                <note rend="inline" type="source">123.G58/111: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-27T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 27,
                                1920—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:40 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>72. Presented my credentials Saturday; took charge today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
